---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Mentric | Built by Coaches, for Coaches" description="Learn the story behind Mentric, the coaching platform built by people who understand the craft. Our mission: measurable, meaningful coaching impact.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-hero-animated">
    <div class="absolute top-16 right-[10%] w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-primary/[0.03] blur-3xl animate-float"></div>
    <div class="section-container relative py-16 md:py-24">
      <p class="category-label mb-4">About</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-4xl">
        Built by coaches, <span class="text-primary">for coaches</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg md:text-xl">
        We understand the challenges of running a coaching practice because
        we have lived them. Mentric exists because coaches deserve better.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">Our story</p>
        <h2 class="mb-8">The Mentric story</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Mentric was born from a simple frustration: there was no platform built
            specifically for coaching. Coaches were forced to stitch together
            spreadsheets, generic project management tools, and disconnected apps
            , losing time, losing data, and losing the ability to show the real
            impact of their work.
          </p>
          <p>
            The vision was clear from the start. Coaching should be structured,
            measurable, and beautiful. It should feel as professional and
            considered as the work coaches do every day. Not another clunky tool
            bolted onto an HR system, but something purpose-built, designed
            around how coaches actually think and work.
          </p>
          <p>
            From the very first wireframe, coaches have been at the heart of every
            decision. Every feature has been shaped by real conversations with
            real coaches, tested, refined, and rebuilt until it felt right. Not
            features for the sake of features, but tools that genuinely make a
            difference to how coaching is delivered.
          </p>
          <p>
            That is what Mentric is: a platform that respects the craft of coaching
            and gives practitioners the tools to do their best work, while making
            it effortless to evidence the impact along the way.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Mission -->
  <section class="bg-background">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">Purpose</p>
        <h2 class="mb-6">Our mission</h2>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed">
          To give every coach the tools to deliver measurable, meaningful
          impact, and every organisation the visibility to invest in
          coaching with confidence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="card-editorial p-8">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-4 block">01</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Coaching-first</h4>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Built specifically for coaching, not adapted from generic project
            management or HR tools. Every feature exists because a coach needed it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-editorial p-8">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-4 block">02</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Beautifully simple</h4>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Powerful features that feel intuitive, not overwhelming. Complexity
            under the surface, clarity on top.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-editorial p-8">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-4 block">03</span>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Measurably impactful</h4>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Everything traces back to outcomes you can see and evidence.
            Coaching impact should never be a matter of opinion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Believe -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">Principles</p>
        <h2 class="mb-12">What we believe</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 max-w-4xl" data-reveal-stagger>
        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-8 py-2">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light italic leading-snug text-ink">
            Every coaching conversation has the potential to transform a career.
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-8 py-2">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light italic leading-snug text-ink">
            Great coaches deserve great tools.
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-8 py-2">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light italic leading-snug text-ink">
            The best technology stays out of the way.
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-8 py-2">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light italic leading-snug text-ink">
            Measuring impact doesn't mean losing the human touch.
          </p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Team -->
  <section class="bg-background">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label justify-center">The team</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3">The people behind Mentric</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
          Mentric was founded by two people who saw the same problem from
          different angles and decided to do something about it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Richard -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <img
            src="/images/richard-anderson.png"
            alt="Richard Anderson, Co-Founder of Mentric"
            class="w-48 h-48 mx-auto mb-6"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">Richard Anderson</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mt-1 mb-4">Co-Founder</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed max-w-sm mx-auto">
            Former founder in the assessment industry, Rich built and exited
            Evolve Assess after seven years. A passionate believer in the power
            of coaching, he spent years on the receiving end of it, gave a
            little back, and kept running into the same problem: the tools
            simply weren't good enough. Mentric is his answer to that.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Jim -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <img
            src="/images/jim-waring.png"
            alt="Jim Waring, Co-Founder of Mentric"
            class="w-48 h-48 mx-auto mb-6"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">Jim Waring</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mt-1 mb-4">Co-Founder</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed max-w-sm mx-auto">
            A former CFO across multiple businesses from start-up through to
            +£50m turnover, Jim has extensive experience in scaling companies.
            Jim brings the commercial rigour and operational experience that
            turns a good idea into a sustainable business. He knows that
            structured, consistent coaching supercharges a business's growth
            potential. Mentric is the tool to do this.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- By the Numbers -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">By the numbers</p>
        <h2>What Mentric brings to the table</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card">
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">All</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">In one platform</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card">
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">CPD</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Hours tracked</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card">
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">AA</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">WCAG accessible</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card">
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">AI</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Powered insights</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Makes Us Different -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-reveal>
        <p class="category-label mb-3">What makes us different</p>
        <h2 class="mb-10">Not just another SaaS tool</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="flex gap-5">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary/20 shrink-0">01</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Designed with coaches, not for them</h4>
            <p class="text-muted">
              Every feature is shaped by real conversations with practising
              coaches. We don't assume. We listen, prototype, and refine.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-5">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary/20 shrink-0">02</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Methodology-agnostic</h4>
            <p class="text-muted">
              Whether you follow GROW, OSCAR, or your own framework, Mentric
              adapts to how you coach, not the other way around.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-5">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary/20 shrink-0">03</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Privacy and trust at the core</h4>
            <p class="text-muted">
              Coaching relationships are built on trust. Mentric is GDPR
              compliant, uses encrypted storage, and gives coaches full
              control over their data.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-5">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary/20 shrink-0">04</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Beautiful by default</h4>
            <p class="text-muted">
              Coaching is a professional craft. The tools you use should
              reflect that: polished, considered, and a pleasure to use.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="bg-plum-gradient">
    <div class="section-container py-16 md:py-24 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-200 mb-4">Get in Touch</p>
      <h2 class="text-white max-w-3xl mx-auto">Want to learn more?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-primary-200">
        We'd love to hear from you and show you what Mentric can do.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary-lg bg-white text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:shadow-glow-lg">
          Book a Demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
